        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    income = 120000\n    tax_brackets = [\n        (10000, 0.00),\n        (40000, 0.10),\n        (90000, 0.20),\n        (float(\"inf\"), 0.30),\n    ]\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    total_tax = 0\n    previous_limit = 0\n\n    for limit, rate in tax_brackets:\n        taxable_income = min(income, limit) - previous_limit\n        if taxable_income > 0:\n            total_tax += taxable_income * rate\n        if income <= limit:\n            break\n        previous_limit = limit\n\n    effective_tax_rate = (total_tax / income) * 100\n    answer = round(effective_tax_rate, 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
